Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.98,0:00:01.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（游马）星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.26,0:00:04.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）艾利法斯说过。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.29,0:00:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把未来托付给我们。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.92,0:00:11.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以不能哭哭啼啼的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.43,0:00:16.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}继承了许多同伴的意志我们……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.52,0:00:19.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.02,0:00:21.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这场决斗，一定要赢。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:24.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（上千主上）不过是破坏了异晶界网络
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.57,0:00:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把生命值恢复过来而已{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.04,0:00:28.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就以为能赢我？哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.98,0:00:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.74,0:00:37.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我在此刻将除外的 CNo.1{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.90,0:00:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌异晶界之门·新宇宙之力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.50,0:00:41.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.51,0:00:47.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（纳修）但是场上已经没有
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.56,0:00:49.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶界网络了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.18,0:00:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你的异晶界新宇宙之力会被破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.04,0:00:55.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 我们就
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.07,0:00:56.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不会因为新纽尼亚的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.54,0:00:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而受到５００００的伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.95,0:00:58.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.22,0:01:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愚蠢。这是神的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.99,0:01:06.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无论如何你们都只有绝望。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.90,0:01:08.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.45,0:01:11.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}源数混沌仪式！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.05,0:01:14.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}源数新纽尼亚被破坏时发动{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.79,0:01:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}选择我墓地里的源数网络和
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.51,0:01:20.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}４只 No.怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.75,0:01:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将它们全部
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.87,0:01:24.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}视为等级１２的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.38,0:01:26.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.75,0:01:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将成为等级１２的 No.１到４{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.38,0:01:34.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后用源数网络 叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.11,0:01:37.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.70,0:01:42.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧，CiNo.1000！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.55,0:01:48.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌之忧，乃人之丑恶业障。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.47,0:01:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}天地之梦，乃无穷之幻。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.55,0:01:59.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虚无之神啊以黑暗，向光芒挥下铁槌。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.18,0:02:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梦幻虚神 纽美罗尼亚斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.10,0:03:40.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这、这就是 CiNo.1000！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.03,0:03:43.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能……攻击力10000！？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.73,0:03:48.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们这些家伙，只能在这股力量面前屈服。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.07,0:03:52.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，纽美罗尼亚斯，攻击黑暗骑士。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.17,0:03:56.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以10000的攻击力给我消失得无影无踪吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.85,0:03:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎、怎么会！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.63,0:04:00.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.97,0:04:01.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想得美！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.96,0:04:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动 优势位置！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.86,0:04:07.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与水性怪兽战斗的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.59,0:04:09.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.76,0:04:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在战斗期间减半{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.43,0:04:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}保护我的怪兽不被破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.18,0:04:18.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是不死心。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.89,0:04:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，伤害你还是得接下！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.84,0:04:34.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且这份伤害星光体世界也会承受。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.67,0:04:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（艾娜）没事的。没事的哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.38,0:04:43.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马他们正在战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.89,0:04:46.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了我们，为了大家的未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.60,0:04:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以，要相信。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.44,0:04:53.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}撑住了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.17,0:04:57.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，努梅罗尼亚斯的真正力量从现在才开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.48,0:04:59.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动努梅罗尼亚斯的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.41,0:05:03.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}双方的回合，战斗结束时
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.41,0:05:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方怪兽全部破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.80,0:05:07.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.20,0:05:10.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}暗黑骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.96,0:05:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，这个回合
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.36,0:05:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被送入墓地的所有怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.35,0:05:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在我方场地上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以表侧守备表示特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.35,0:05:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 就这样回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.53,0:05:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！ 好厉害的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.64,0:05:27.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样下去的话…。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.57,0:05:28.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.94,0:05:31.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我怎么可能输啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.78,0:05:35.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们身上承载着大家托付的心意{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.79,0:05:38.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}未来都塞满在这胸膛里了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.42,0:05:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧！ 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.97,0:05:41.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.89,0:05:45.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 和我自身！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.59,0:05:46.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和我！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.81,0:05:48.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.36,0:05:57.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（ZEXAL）强烈的羁绊引导光芒！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.12,0:05:59.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量变身{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.67,0:06:02.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}ZEXAL！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.66,0:06:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是 第一次游马和星光体合体后的ZEXAL！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.53,0:06:09.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}千尊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.71,0:06:13.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你我们要用我们的全部{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把你打趴下！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.86,0:06:15.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身了吗，泽阿尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.11,0:06:18.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但就凭这个，你以为能赢我？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.84,0:06:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊，会赢的！一定！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.58,0:06:22.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.97,0:06:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有的光啊，力量啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.00,0:06:28.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}寄宿于我的右臂照亮希望之路吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.55,0:06:33.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}闪光抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.72,0:06:36.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡，重新超量！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.86,0:06:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}选择墓地的怪兽超量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.90,0:06:43.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将其召唤所需的怪兽也{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地选择！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.41,0:06:46.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我将墓地的等级4
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.05,0:06:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我我我魔术师和玩具骑士叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.29,0:06:52.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.18,0:06:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！No.39希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.99,0:07:05.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}垂死挣扎！我发动源数网络更进一步的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.44,0:07:09.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}消耗1个混沌超量素材{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.07,0:07:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏对方场上的1只怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.44,0:07:14.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.56,0:07:16.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后，将对方额外卡组中的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.85,0:07:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只 CNo.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.46,0:07:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无视召唤条件特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.15,0:07:26.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧！希望皇霍普雷·胜利！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.83,0:07:30.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为、为什么破坏了霍普
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.73,0:07:33.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还特意把胜利召唤到我们场上？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.97,0:07:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼！只要源数网络在场
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.87,0:07:39.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方的 CNo.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.93,0:07:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽效果会被无效
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.00,0:07:43.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，也无法攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.43,0:07:47.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们所拥有的 CNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.83,0:07:49.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在我面前将变得毫无力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.32,0:07:52.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会！那游马他们呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.02,0:07:53.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没完！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.88,0:07:56.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们才不会放弃！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.79,0:08:03.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我说过了吧，用上所有的力量将你打倒！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.09,0:08:09.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}炽热的激情会引领胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.14,0:08:11.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量·二段·变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.62,0:08:14.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}泽阿尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.94,0:08:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是第二个泽阿尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.23,0:08:19.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:21.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量·宝藏！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.44,0:08:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡的效果是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.47,0:08:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上每有1只超量怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.09,0:08:28.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就抽1张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.84,0:08:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此，抽3张卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.77,0:08:35.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最强决斗者的决斗一切都是必然。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.65,0:08:38.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就连抽到的卡，也是由决斗者创造的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.51,0:08:40.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}三重 闪耀抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.11,0:08:43.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了！唐·千！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.03,0:08:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤泽阿尔伺服·衔尾蛇·贤者！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.12,0:08:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张怪兽召唤成功时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.91,0:08:55.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将墓地中光属性以外的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.29,0:08:58.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1只怪兽特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.56,0:09:03.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 No.101
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.24,0:09:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}寂静荣誉方舟骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.27,0:09:11.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后衔尾蛇贤者的更进一步效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.86,0:09:13.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将衔尾蛇贤者与 场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.78,0:09:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}冠有霍普之名的怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.86,0:09:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备给通过这个效果特殊召唤的方舟骑士{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.23,0:09:22.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将那2只的攻击力加给它！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.03,0:09:25.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！ 我用
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.06,0:09:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}方舟骑士 攻击 努梅罗尼亚斯！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.47,0:09:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会！？ 攻击力是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.44,0:09:31.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}方舟骑士这边
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.89,0:09:32.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}明明更低啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.33,0:09:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就在这个瞬间 衔尾蛇贤者的更进一步效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.20,0:09:40.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}装备了这张卡的怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.19,0:09:42.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力变成２倍！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.37,0:09:46.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力１１０００！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.71,0:09:50.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是我们的力量！　上啊～！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.88,0:10:02.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把努梅罗尼乌斯劈成两半～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.12,0:10:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑　弧光骑士斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.16,0:10:19.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.24,0:10:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}成功了～！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.87,0:10:24.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这下就把努梅罗尼乌斯解决掉了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.54,0:10:25.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不……。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.99,0:10:30.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？　努梅罗尼乌斯没有被破坏！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.29,0:10:34.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙场地上的暗黑骑士不见了！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.08,0:10:36.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我在受到攻击的瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.91,0:10:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动了努梅罗尼乌斯的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.07,0:10:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}通过将自身１只怪兽送去墓地{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.11,0:10:45.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无效了努梅罗尼乌斯的破坏。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.97,0:10:48.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}居然还有这种效果！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.16,0:10:52.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后　努梅罗尼乌斯的效果发动！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.88,0:10:56.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗结束时将对手的所有怪兽破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.83,0:11:03.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且 这个回合{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.40,0:11:06.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被送入墓地的所有怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.71,0:11:07.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在我的场地上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.96,0:11:12.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以表侧守备表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.55,0:11:16.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 就算是泽阿尔的力量也……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.81,0:11:19.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}该怎么对付那家伙！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.90,0:11:23.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马绝对无法抗拒混沌之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.19,0:11:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为人类正是混沌的根源。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.09,0:11:29.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.64,0:11:35.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错 那股混沌之力让我复活了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.30,0:11:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安七皇的记忆是被篡改了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.95,0:11:44.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体 在那场古老的战斗中我确实败了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.59,0:11:48.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 你的力量也 因为那时的冲击
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.42,0:11:50.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成了50张 No.卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.49,0:11:53.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}更进一步　将源数代码的所在
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.95,0:11:55.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刻入那些卡中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.16,0:11:58.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}散布到了人类的世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.69,0:12:04.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后　我的力量也被封印进7张 No.卡中{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.37,0:12:09.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}托付给了被选中的地上勇者贤者们。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.67,0:12:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是遗迹的 No.卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.22,0:12:16.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以　对那些得到那些 No.卡的人施以诅咒！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.05,0:12:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.59,0:12:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了让我复活成为我的食粮{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.37,0:12:24.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我赐予了他们混沌之力。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.66,0:12:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们人类　太弱了。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.36,0:12:31.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正因为那份软弱才会轻易被混沌吞噬。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.80,0:12:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而　那正是你最信赖的朋友　德鲁贝。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.67,0:12:43.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是比自己的性命更重要的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.31,0:12:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梅拉格也不例外。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.77,0:12:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.67,0:12:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纳什 你这家伙也
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.60,0:13:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是被我的诅咒引导而来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.83,0:13:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 你这家伙 会作为巴利安
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.77,0:13:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}转生而来{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.89,0:13:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你迟早会知道的。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.03,0:13:07.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.30,0:13:09.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}千尊大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.81,0:13:12.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人类或许确实很弱。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.23,0:13:16.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 我 可不会像你那样使用混沌！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.63,0:13:21.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的混沌是用来守护某人的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.25,0:13:24.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是与同伴一起活下去的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.10,0:13:27.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 我们绝对不会输！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.05,0:13:31.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我盖上四张卡 回合结束！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.66,0:13:34.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要依靠那所谓的微弱希望吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.20,0:13:37.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.66,0:13:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吾发动魔法卡——源数风暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.53,0:13:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当场上存在源数神时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.27,0:13:48.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对手的魔法、陷阱全部破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.34,0:13:52.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，你这家伙就失去了一切。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.50,0:13:55.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并且，由于这张卡的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.49,0:13:56.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予对手玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.52,0:13:58.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}1000点伤害！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.05,0:14:08.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会…生命值只剩100了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.35,0:14:11.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们场上没有怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.68,0:14:14.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}盖牌、手牌也是零！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.31,0:14:16.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}毁灭之时到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.20,0:14:20.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}源数神 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.69,0:14:28.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（上千主上）毁灭之时到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.59,0:14:32.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}源数神 直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.69,0:14:34.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.04,0:14:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉了，各位！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.08,0:14:41.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.44,0:14:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种程度就要放弃了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.35,0:14:50.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能…你是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.01,0:14:54.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不、不会吧……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.42,0:14:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）你平时的一飞冲天怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.63,0:14:59.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}磨蹭鬼。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.07,0:15:01.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.02,0:15:05.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我把一切　都托付给你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.56,0:15:08.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢啊　游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.94,0:15:11.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.44,0:15:14.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.19,0:15:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从快斗那里托付来的努梅隆龙的效果……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.20,0:15:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗给了我们？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.56,0:15:23.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.06,0:15:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.39,0:15:29.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体　鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.06,0:15:33.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动　No.100
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.75,0:15:35.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}努梅隆龙的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.15,0:15:36.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.92,0:15:39.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己手牌　场上没有卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.25,0:15:41.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到敌人直接攻击的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.95,0:15:45.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从额外卡组以守备表示特殊召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.57,0:15:50.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}宇宙创造之钥现在正是开启暗之扉之时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.75,0:15:53.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与那咆哮一同引领未来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.59,0:15:57.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降临吧 No.100！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.26,0:16:02.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}源数龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.24,0:16:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能……。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.49,0:16:08.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们这些家伙居然让源数龙觉醒了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.10,0:16:11.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么我就从那家伙开始轰飞！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.37,0:16:14.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击源数龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.36,0:16:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动源数龙的新效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.36,0:16:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与这张卡战斗的怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.28,0:16:22.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变为零！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.32,0:16:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟然有这种效果……。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.12,0:16:29.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 由于源数网络的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.40,0:16:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗结束时将对手场上的怪兽全部破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.39,0:16:36.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是现在，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.80,0:16:37.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.88,0:16:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动 No.龙的另一个效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.32,0:16:42.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当这张卡被破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.29,0:16:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}场上的所有怪兽都会被破坏！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.56,0:16:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 你的场上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.90,0:16:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经没有怪兽了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.79,0:17:00.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后发动 No.龙 的更进一步效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.70,0:17:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合 被破坏的魔法{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.99,0:17:06.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱卡 全部复活！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.83,0:17:09.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的希望之光
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.41,0:17:11.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没有消失 千尊！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.21,0:17:14.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}愚蠢…… 看来你还不明白啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.83,0:17:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你自己打开了更深的绝望之门。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.63,0:17:22.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}当 No.尼亚斯 被破坏时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.88,0:17:24.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将墓地中的这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.47,0:17:27.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为超量素材 叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.58,0:17:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}灭绝！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.51,0:17:36.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量 变换！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.57,0:17:42.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}降临吧 混沌虚数 No. 1000！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.14,0:17:47.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我之天悠长 地亦久远。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.15,0:17:51.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}人所依偎的梦不过是一场幻象。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.97,0:17:56.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}虚无的大神啊以暗为力 向光挥下铁锤！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.68,0:18:01.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梦幻虚光神 努梅罗尼亚斯·努梅罗尼亚！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.26,0:18:04.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阶级13的 CNo.！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.15,0:18:06.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力 10万！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.41,0:18:06.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.93,0:18:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（千尊）这张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.32,0:18:11.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不能自行攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.13,0:18:14.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 这张卡在场上的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.87,0:18:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对方必须用怪兽进行攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.44,0:18:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果不攻击的话在那个回合结束时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.43,0:18:23.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就会败北。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.69,0:18:27.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（纳修）面对攻击力10万的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.10,0:18:28.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}必须攻击…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.44,0:18:31.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么会！绝对不可能赢的。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.35,0:18:34.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（千尊）呵呵呵呵 明白了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.17,0:18:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们所剩下的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.68,0:18:40.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经不存在了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.67,0:18:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不会放弃。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.28,0:18:48.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对不会放弃。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.51,0:18:50.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直到最后一刻！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.62,0:18:52.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了那些
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.41,0:18:54.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将心愿托付给我们而逝去的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.96,0:18:56.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}同伴们…。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.80,0:18:59.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能放弃啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.27,0:19:01.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 鲨鱼 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.41,0:19:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是当然 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.89,0:19:06.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一起上吧 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.41,0:19:08.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和我一起。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.47,0:19:09.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用我。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.09,0:19:11.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.69,0:19:16.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（泽阿尔）耀眼希望之光指引未来。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.84,0:19:19.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}究极 超量变换
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.38,0:19:21.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}泽阿尔！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.27,0:19:24.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔 第三次泽阿尔吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.82,0:19:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（泽阿尔）陷阱发动 会话抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.94,0:19:30.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下个回合 抽卡时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.90,0:19:33.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与通常抽卡不同抽1张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.95,0:19:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}此时 抽到的2张卡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.74,0:19:38.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}若是相同等级的怪兽卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.38,0:19:41.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能用2张卡进行超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.84,0:19:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼 要抓住那微弱的希望吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.90,0:19:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 就此回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.62,0:19:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上了 游马 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.01,0:19:53.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊 这就是我们命运的抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.35,0:19:57.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶人混沌抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.78,0:20:02.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（泽阿尔）命运闪耀抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.73,0:20:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来了　我抽到的卡是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.86,0:20:10.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异热同心武器　旋风双翼！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.08,0:20:14.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我抽到的卡是　豹鲨！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.15,0:20:16.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}它们的等级　都是５。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.97,0:20:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（２人）我们用２张卡进行叠放！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.20,0:20:22.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（纳修）超量召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.86,0:20:27.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧　No.７３。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.24,0:20:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}激泷神 深渊溅射！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.06,0:20:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后　我发动　陷阱卡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.96,0:20:35.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶希望之力！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.30,0:20:40.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤墓地中的希望皇霍普{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.44,0:20:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}并将这张卡装备给它。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.28,0:20:46.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动　陷阱卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.44,0:20:47.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望的羁绊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.21,0:20:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上有怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.46,0:20:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.09,0:20:56.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从墓地中将新的怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.45,0:20:57.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.01,0:21:00.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧　No.１００。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.90,0:21:03.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}源数龙！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.53,0:21:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 希望的羁绊可以将自己场上的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.77,0:21:09.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怪兽超量怪兽的全部超量素材
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.74,0:21:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和这张卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.76,0:21:13.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变成另一只超量怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.42,0:21:15.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.97,0:21:17.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 选择霍普。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.47,0:21:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来霍普的超量素材就是３个了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.07,0:21:25.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 我们的希望就托付给你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.54,0:21:27.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.27,0:21:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 发动装备在霍普身上的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.47,0:21:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}升阶霍普的进一步效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.52,0:21:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}获得使用源数龙和 深渊溅射的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.22,0:21:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量素材的效果。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.14,0:21:41.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？ 将所有的怪兽效果
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.61,0:21:44.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都集中到霍普１只身上了？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.91,0:21:49.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是 ３只怪兽……。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.26,0:21:53.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 鲨鱼 快斗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.00,0:21:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家的力量合而为一……。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.72,0:21:57.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上千主上！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.70,0:22:01.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的思念 我们的希望……。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.01,0:22:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在就让你好好接下吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.70,0:23:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.12,0:23:47.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.25,0:23:49.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.13,0:23:53.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.74,0:23:55.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.21,0:23:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.10,0:24:00.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.47,0:24:04.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.44,0:24:08.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
